!            Overflow! Greater than INTMAX.
!            Integer part        :   2147483647
!
!         Double precision number:   -1.5000000000000000E+035
!            Overflow! Smaller than INTMIN.
!            Integer part        :  -2147483648
!
!         Double precision number:    1.6000000000000001
