!     to 1899 DEC 31 12:00:00 (1900 JAN 0.5).
!
! $ Parameters
!
!     None.
!
! $ Exceptions
!
!     Error free.
!
! $ Files
!
!     None.
!
! $ Particulars
!
!     The function always returns the constant value shown above.
